#
# Test-harness-local Emits SigOp `emit : Eff Int Unit` (Plan 0.36) — RISC-V 64.
# Runtime = NOP (like Emit.x86_64): the observable is the SigOp trace, not
# stdout. Takes its Int argument in a0 (Once RV64 Output/Input convention),
# returns Unit; touches no callee-saved register.

.text
.align 4
.global emit
.type emit, @function
emit:
    ret
.size emit, .-emit
